description:
everyone will admire you when you wear this stunning blue and purple embroidered designer lehenga choli. 
the lehenga is made of mulberry silk fabric that has been enhanced with lovely heavy floral embroidery all over with stone embellishments.
the lehenga having heavy zari, sequins and cording embroidered border at the bottom part which makes this outfit perfect for any occasion. 
it comes along with unstitched purple mulberry silk blouse piece with thread, dori, zari, and sequins embroidery with stonework.
it has embroidered lace soft netted orange colored dupatta to complete the look. 
specially designed to wear for wedding functions, receptions, engagement ceremony, and family occasions, where you want to be the center of attraction. 
pair it up with classy accessories and heels to make your look more attractive. 

lehenga (semi-stitched) details:-
fabric: mulberry silk (with fusing);
work: thread, dori, zari, and sequins embroidery with stonework;
inner: satin with can-can layered net;
waist size: up to 42";
height: 42";

blouse (unstitched) details:-
fabric: mulberry silk (with fusing);
work: thread, dori, zari, sequins embroidery with stonework;
sleeves: half sleeves;
bust size: up to 42";

dupatta details:-
fabric: soft net;
work: embroidery;
length: 2.25 meter;

